    "title": "WhatCut +",
    "description": "What haircut will suit you best? Find out with WhatCut! Our innovative app uses artificial intelligence to analyze your face and recommend the cut style that best suits you. No more doubts or mistakes, just looks that enhance your beauty.\r\n\r\nMain features:\r\n\r\nPersonalized recommendations: Upload a photo of your face and let our AI do the rest. You will receive suggestions for cuts that suit your face shape, your style and your preferences.\r\nSocial cuts network: Join our community and share your favorite cuts. Get inspired by other users' photos and find the look you've always wanted.\r\n\r\nCut history: Save cuts that you liked or have recently had. This way you can easily show them to your hairdresser on your next visit.\r\n\r\nWhatCut is your image advisor and your source of inspiration in a single app. Download it now and transform your style with just a few clicks.",
